{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は家族のチップちゃんの\nお誕生日です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10歳のお誕生日おめでとう(*´꒳`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で京都にいるため会えないから\n夕方に妹にテレビ電話してもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声に反応して\n窓から外を覗いてたり\n声を聞いてしっぽ振ってくれてたけど\nテレビ電話はわからなくて\nこっちみてくれなかった(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕方ない。会えてないのだから怒ってて当然だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、ここはいっちょケーキを買って\n帰ろうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/01/2782066/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/01/2782066/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/01/2782066/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/01/2782066/0003.jpeg","alt"